    "id": "75571",
    "original": "兄が急逝したのは２年前、義姉は一人兄の遺した小さな宝飾店を健気に守ってきた。",
    "en": [
      {
        "id": "328147",
        "text": "Since my brother died suddenly two years ago, my sister-in-law has valiantly kept going the small jewellery store he left her."
